WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.398 --> 00:00:03.923
(door hinge squeaks)

00:00:03.923 --> 00:00:06.506
(siren blares)

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:09.975
(man mumbles)

00:00:09.975 --> 00:00:11.515
- Everything's taken care of

00:00:11.515 --> 00:00:12.484
- Absolutely.

00:00:12.484 --> 00:00:13.543
Hi, Lana.

00:00:13.543 --> 00:00:15.212
Thank you so much for coming in.

00:00:15.212 --> 00:00:17.912
I'm detective Snipes,
this is detective Kerry.

00:00:17.912 --> 00:00:21.198
We are currently investigating
the murder of Steven Calgary.

00:00:21.198 --> 00:00:22.069
- Ugh, that's like the saddest thing

00:00:22.069 --> 00:00:24.201
to ever happen in history, right?

00:00:24.201 --> 00:00:26.421
- Yeah, it sure is.

00:00:26.421 --> 00:00:28.830
- So, from what we're
told, you're dating Steven?

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:31.613
- Da-ted, we broke up last week.

00:00:31.613 --> 00:00:34.313
It's like a crazy long
story, but basically,

00:00:34.313 --> 00:00:37.315
he cheated on me with the
ugliest bitch in America.

00:00:37.315 --> 00:00:39.074
She's, like, literally a dog.

00:00:39.074 --> 00:00:40.434
- He cheated on you with a canine?

00:00:40.434 --> 00:00:43.166
- Can you tell us where you
were the night of August 20th?

00:00:43.166 --> 00:00:46.254
- Ugh, don't judge me,
but I was at Burger King.

00:00:46.254 --> 00:00:48.704
I hadn't eaten in, like, a year.

00:00:48.704 --> 00:00:51.976
- Wait-wait, I'm sorry, you
said you hadn't eaten in a year?

00:00:51.976 --> 00:00:54.281
You would be dead if you
didn't eat in a year.

00:00:54.281 --> 00:00:56.030
Your story's not adding
up, people gotta eat.

00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:57.104
Checkers says it, you gotta eat--

00:00:57.104 --> 00:00:59.238
- Yes, let her finish.

00:00:59.238 --> 00:01:01.577
So you're at Burger
King eating that night.

00:01:01.577 --> 00:01:02.818
Was Steven there?

00:01:02.818 --> 00:01:04.122
- Oh, no.

00:01:04.122 --> 00:01:05.986
- When was the last time you saw Steven?

00:01:05.986 --> 00:01:09.394
- Oh, I haven't seen Steven
in like, a hundred years.

00:01:09.394 --> 00:01:11.133
- You said you broke up
with him last week, though?

00:01:11.133 --> 00:01:12.297
- I know.

00:01:12.297 --> 00:01:14.227
- Last week is not a hundred years.

00:01:14.227 --> 00:01:15.717
A hundred years is a hundred years.

00:01:15.717 --> 00:01:17.319
- Do you remember the last
thing you saw him doing?

00:01:17.319 --> 00:01:19.080
Any person he might have been with?

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:22.170
- Yes, he was in a fight with, like,

00:01:22.170 --> 00:01:24.459
the tallest man in the world.

00:01:24.459 --> 00:01:26.560
- He was in a fight with Sultan Kösen?

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:28.138
- [Lana] Who?

00:01:28.138 --> 00:01:29.581
- Sultan Kösen is the
tallest man in the world.

00:01:29.581 --> 00:01:32.255
It's a 2007 Guinness Book world record.

00:01:32.255 --> 00:01:34.664
Is it just me, I'm the
only one who follows that?

00:01:34.664 --> 00:01:35.784
Sultan Kösen?

00:01:35.784 --> 00:01:37.623
- Do you remember what
this tall man looked like?

00:01:37.623 --> 00:01:39.540
- Yes, he was very old.

00:01:41.124 --> 00:01:42.370
- How old?

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:43.355
- Like a million years old.

00:01:43.355 --> 00:01:44.446
- Cut it, cut it, I'm tired of it--

00:01:44.446 --> 00:01:45.279
- No, wait, calm down--

00:01:45.279 --> 00:01:46.112
- Something's not going on here.

00:01:46.112 --> 00:01:46.945
- Calm down, Kerry.

00:01:46.945 --> 00:01:47.778
- Something's not going on!

00:01:47.778 --> 00:01:49.051
- Alright, calm down.

00:01:49.051 --> 00:01:51.405
- [Kerry] Okay, okay, okay.

00:01:51.405 --> 00:01:52.238
(sighs heavily)

00:01:52.238 --> 00:01:54.563
- Okay, Lana, we need some
real numbers from you now.

00:01:54.563 --> 00:01:55.489
There's a murderer out there,

00:01:55.489 --> 00:01:57.195
and you can help us bring him in.

00:01:57.195 --> 00:02:01.355
Now, on the night on the fight
with this older, tall man,

00:02:01.355 --> 00:02:03.189
do you remember where that was?

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:05.194
- Over on Oak Street, in front of

00:02:05.194 --> 00:02:08.735
one of the grossest warehouses,
with like 50 blue trucks.

00:02:08.735 --> 00:02:10.141
- Okay, blue trucks, it's a number,

00:02:10.141 --> 00:02:11.649
a big number, but a number.

00:02:11.649 --> 00:02:13.327
Look up all blue trucks in the area,

00:02:13.327 --> 00:02:15.218
warehouses, garages, anything.

00:02:15.218 --> 00:02:16.930
Anything else you remember?

00:02:16.930 --> 00:02:18.981
- Don't ask me what I was doing there.

00:02:18.981 --> 00:02:22.017
Second base with Jimmy Leharry.

00:02:22.017 --> 00:02:24.043
- If there's someone else
there, we need to talk to him.

00:02:24.043 --> 00:02:25.284
Does Jimmy live in the city?

00:02:25.284 --> 00:02:26.372
- Yes.

00:02:26.372 --> 00:02:27.205
- Where?

00:02:27.205 --> 00:02:28.561
- Like a bajillion miles away.

00:02:28.561 --> 00:02:32.283
- God damn it, I can't do this anymore.

00:02:32.283 --> 00:02:33.116
(Door slams)

00:02:33.116 --> 00:02:35.076
- I had eaten like 50
burgers, and I remember this,

00:02:35.076 --> 00:02:39.145
because Tiffany was joking
that I turned into Kevin James,

00:02:39.145 --> 00:02:41.386
and I, like, literally died.

00:02:41.386 --> 00:02:44.019
- If you ate 50 burgers,
you would actually,

00:02:44.019 --> 00:02:46.758
literally be dead right now.

00:02:46.758 --> 00:02:47.818
You're not telling us the truth.

00:02:47.818 --> 00:02:50.110
What's really going on, huh?

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:51.492
Who's Kevin James?

00:02:51.492 --> 00:02:52.852
(woman laughs)

00:02:52.852 --> 00:02:55.519
(laughs loudly)

